  "body": "I find code like the below around the place: \r\n\r\n```JS\r\nfunction stripQuery(url) {\r\n  return url.split(\"?\")[0];\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm wondering if the spec could just provide a means to get a URL without query params (and I guess the same for hash). ",
